OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to improve key road between
OL,4,ASussex and Surrey
OL,5,
OL,6,FA consultation has opened on proposals
OL,7,Fdesigned to improve journeys on a key
OL,8,Froad between towns in Sussex and
OL,9,FSurrey.
OL,11,FWest Sussex County Council (WSCC) and
OL,12,FSurrey County Council (SCC) have
OL,13,Fpublished planned changes to the A24
OL,14,Fbetween Worthing, Horsham and Dorking,
OL,15,Ffollowing a request last year for
OL,16,Ffeedback on initial plans.
OL,18,FThe changes include junction
OL,19,Fadaptations to reduce congestion,
OL,20,Fadditional safety barriers, speed limit
OL,21,Fchanges and new paths and crossings.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
