OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to improve key road between
OL,4,ASussex and Surrey
OL,5,
OL,6,FErika Woodhurst-Trueman, WSCC cabinet
OL,7,Fmember for highways and transport, said
OL,8,Fthe councils had an "opportunity to
OL,9,Fmake journeys safer and more reliable,
OL,10,Fsupport better public transport
OL,11,Fservices and provide improved paths".
